OL,3,GNEWSAWe were sightseeing in Krakow and
OL,4,Ahad sat down for drinks - then the
OL,5,Ashooting began
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo friends from Aberdeen have
OL,8,Fdescribed how they ran for their lives
OL,9,Fduring a shooting in Krakow in which
OL,10,Fsix people were killed.
OL,12,FCiaran McMenemy, 26, and Charlie
OL,13,FHutchison, 27, had just sat down for a
OL,14,Fdrink when the gunfire began. They
OL,15,Fquickly fled and took shelter.
OL,17,FNow back in Scotland, McMenemy told BBC
OL,18,FScotland News they had felt like
OL,19,F"sitting ducks" - and feared they may
OL,20,Fnever see their loved ones again.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
