OL,3,GNEWSAWe were sightseeing in Krakow and
OL,4,Ahad sat down for drinks - then the
OL,5,Ashooting began
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe 24-year-old suspected gunman - who
OL,8,Flater died in hospital - had opened
OL,9,Ffire in central Krakow, the second
OL,10,Flargest city in Poland, on Saturday.
